---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: record
description: Hi you found me! This is my personal journal
---
{%- set periods = collections.record | byPeriod %}
<header class="column">
  <h1>Zuhayrium</h1>
  <p>I’m Zuhayr. I do science stuff: electronics, AI, and whatever I can learn by building it before I feel ready. I also solder things, fly planes in simulators, and get a big smile when I see someone running their first line of code. This is where I keep a record of what I’ve made, tried, and written. Opinions are my own; feel free to disagree.</p>
  <nav aria-label="Elsewhere">
    <ul class="routes">
      <li><a href="https://github.com/TheRealDarkCoder/">GitHub</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ahmed-zuhayr/">LinkedIn</a></li>
      <li><a href="/blogs/">All writing</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <nav class="contents" aria-labelledby="contents-title">
    <h2 class="column" id="contents-title">Record of Activities</h2>
    <ul class="periods">
      {%- for period in periods %}
      <li>
        <a class="period-link" href="#{{ period.label | slugify }}">{{ period.label }}</a>
        <ul>
          {%- for item in period.items %}
          <li><a href="#{{ item.page.fileSlug }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></li>
          {%- endfor %}
        </ul>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
  </nav>
  {%- for period in periods %}

  <section>
    <h2 class="period" id="{{ period.label | slugify }}">{{ period.label }}</h2>
    {%- for item in period.items %}

    {#- Essays link to their page and show their standfirst; activities have no page, so
        their own content is the note. #}
    <article class="entry" id="{{ item.page.fileSlug }}">
      <h3>{% if item.url %}<a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a>{% else %}{{ item.data.title }}{% endif %}</h3>
      <p class="stamp">
        {%- if item.data.stamp %}{{ item.data.stamp }}
        {%- else %}{% if "writing" in item.data.tags %}Essay published {% endif %}<time datetime="{{ item.data.date | isoDate }}">{{ item.data.date | shortDate }}</time>
          {#- A range: the start date places the entry; the dash stays with it when the stamp wraps. #}
          {%- if item.data.end %}&nbsp;– <time datetime="{{ item.data.end | isoDate }}">{{ item.data.end | shortDate }}</time>{% endif %}
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>
      <div class="note">
        {%- if item.url %}
        <p>{{ item.data.standfirst }}</p>
        {%- else %}
        {{ item.content | safe }}
        {%- endif %}
      </div>
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </section>
  {%- endfor %}
</main>
